      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107201/4001072010300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "撮影、いい感じだったぞ\r\nスタッフさんもよく褒めてたし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001072010310,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "サンキュ\r\nけど、もう少しやれた気もする",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107201/4001072010310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "と言うと？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001072010320,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "いつものカンジにしすぎた感あって\r\n新しさを探すべきかなって",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107201/4001072010320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なるほどな\r\n向上心があって、いいことだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
